        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9025P, New Yorker Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe New Yorker Appliance Handle comes with hardware to mount it on an appliance panel. It can be used on vacuum sealed refrigerators as well as other high-end appliances. The New Yorker Refrigerator Pull is available in 6 modern finishes. Choose from either 12 or 18 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see the matching <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9025\"><b>New Yorker Cabinet Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9025P Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9025P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9025P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
